You know what I'm saying?

01:13:29.593 --> 01:13:30.783
Like, from a--
While it's happening

01:13:30.783 --> 01:13:32.900
you're this.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

01:13:32.900 --> 01:13:35.760
From like a dream come true standpoint

01:13:35.760 --> 01:13:40.500
of performing, doing the thing that,

01:13:40.500 --> 01:13:42.040
doing the thing that we're, you know,

01:13:42.040 --> 01:13:45.690
we do a performance,
