01:15:08.050 --> 01:15:09.520
I was fully present for.

01:15:09.520 --> 01:15:12.460
Yeah, I remember looking at you,

01:15:12.460 --> 01:15:14.180
and then when we were when we were singing

01:15:14.180 --> 01:15:15.260
the Merle songs with Britton,

01:15:15.260 --> 01:15:16.640
like looking at Britton too,

01:15:16.640 --> 01:15:18.943
it's just like having,

01:15:19.920 --> 01:15:21.900
especially when he had the guitar solo,

01:15:21.900 --> 01:15:24.240
